<section class="block" id="proof">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head rv">
      <h2>Proof, not promises</h2>
      <p>Every evasion claim is gated on a live RST-injection simulator in CI. Architecture changes refresh the signed record.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="proof-grid rv">
      <div>
        <h3>DPI simulator</h3>
        <p><code>sudo python3 scripts/dpi_sim.py run --iface lo --targets roblox.com,discord.com</code></p>
        <p>RST with Albus off, bypass with Albus on — both are hard gates, locally and in CI.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Test suites</h3>
        <p>Format, clippy, unit, fuzz, docs, net, watchdog and root suites. Privileged suites run only with root and skip otherwise — never fail spuriously.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Omarchy panel</h3>
        <p>First-party bar widget and control panel with live packet telemetry, resolver switching and keyboard shortcuts.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="proof-foot rv">
      Documentation: <a href="https://github.com/oqullcan/albus/blob/develop/docs/TESTING.md">TESTING.md</a>,
      <a href="https://github.com/oqullcan/albus/blob/develop/docs/TEST_RESULTS.md">TEST_RESULTS.md</a>,
      <a href="https://github.com/oqullcan/albus/blob/develop/SECURITY.md">SECURITY.md</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .proof-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .proof-grid h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 16px; }
  .proof-grid p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .proof-grid code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.88em; color: var(--ink); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .proof-foot { margin-top: 36px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .proof-foot a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
